Extra material for the help2man-generated man page, see mkman.sh.

[DESCRIPTION]
.B furnel
compresses files in BASE_PATH (and, with
.BR \-r ,
its subdirectories) using the brotli algorithm, writing a
.I .br
file next to each input file.

[AUTHOR]
Written by Kristian Thy.

[REPORTING BUGS]
Report bugs at <https://github.com/kthy/furnel/issues>.

[SEE ALSO]
.BR brotli (1)
